v 3
d ebayes_shrink: Stata command for Empirical Bayes shrinkage of fixed-effect estimates
d
d ebayes_shrink applies Empirical Bayes shrinkage to one or more already-estimated fixed effects.
d It uses per-observation variance-covariance estimates to estimate the signal covariance matrix
d and computes posterior mean shrunken effects.
d
d Author: Martin Eckhoff Andresen, University of Oslo
d Repository: https://github.com/martin-andresen/ebayes_shrink
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer
d
f ebayes_shrink.ado
f ebayes_shrink.sthlp
